{% comment %}
@description: Danh sach bai viet lien quan, render o cuoi blog-post.liquid.
@required_substrings: relatedPosts
@required_ids:
@notes: Nhan relatedPosts[] (slug/title/excerpt/coverImage/categories[]) tu blog.ts. Tu an hoan toan khi rong. Link bai viet PHAI dung {{ postUrlPrefix }}/{{ related.slug }} (bien global, ton trong postSlugPrefix tuy chinh) - KHONG hardcode "/blog/".
{% endcomment %}
{% if relatedPosts and relatedPosts.size > 0 %}
<div>
  <ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1.5rem;">
    {% for related in relatedPosts %}
    <li style="flex: 1 1 30%; min-width: 250px; border: 1px solid #eee; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">
      {% if related.coverImage %}
      <a href="{{ postUrlPrefix }}/{{ related.slug }}" style="display: block; height: 160px; overflow: hidden;">
        <img src="{{ related.coverImage }}" alt="{{ related.title | escape }}" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; transition: transform 0.3s ease;">
      </a>
      {% endif %}
      <div style="padding: 1rem;">
        {% if related.categories.size > 0 %}
        <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: #666; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">{{ related.categories[0].name }}</span>
        {% endif %}
        <h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.4;">
          <a href="{{ postUrlPrefix }}/{{ related.slug }}" style="color: #333; text-decoration: none;">{{ related.title }}</a>
        </h3>
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #666; line-height: 1.5;">{{ related.excerpt | truncate: 100 }}</p>
      </div>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</div>
{% endif %}
